+  // fix (woa ckpt 006: "NOPing the MMU-off tlbi alone advances winload past the switch") is found
+  // in winload's OWN .text by pattern: the switch leaf re-enables the MMU right after its flush,
+  // so the switch tlbi vmalle1 is the unique one followed by
+  //   dsb sy ; isb ; msr SCTLR_EL1, x3   (0xd5033f9f, 0xd5033fdf, 0xd5181003)
+  // (verified offline: only 1 of winload's 6 tlbi vmalle1 matches). NOP it -- the hyp cannot
